ining town of 4878 people just nearby the silver mine."},{"id":"marker5","name":"Xarvil — tin mining town","legend":"Xarvil is a mining town of 1017 people just nearby the tin mine."},{"id":"marker6","name":"Ipjigekez — copper mining town","legend":"Ipjigekez is a mining town of 8727 people just nearby the copper mine."},{"id":"marker7","name":"Arithlondreth — silver mining town","legend":"Arithlondreth is a mining town of 6858 people just nearby the silver mine."},{"id":"marker8","name":"Zhak'qos — copper mining town","legend":"Zhak'qos is a mining town of 12875 people just nearby the copper mine."},{"id":"marker9","name":"Bararkoc — tin mining town","legend":"Bararkoc is a mining town of 1575 people just nearby the tin mine."},{"id":"marker10","name":"Vrur Bridge","legend":"An old crossing of the Chegeg River, rarely used since banditry infested the area."},{"id":"marker11","name":"Clearses Bridge","legend":"A stone bridge spans over the Scorcreden River near Clearses."},{"id":"marker12","name":"The Light Jaguar","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious flame-broiled jaguar with ice nectar is served here."},{"id":"marker13","name":"The Grey Antelope","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious fried hare with white whisky is served here."},{"id":"marker14","name":"The Fair Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious pan-fried rabbit with sweet cider is served here."},{"id":"marker15","name":"The Big Owl","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious jugged deer with pink rom is served here."},{"id":"marker16","name":"The White Swan","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious dried sturgeon with white tequila is served here."},{"id":"marker17","name":"The Black Jackal","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious pan-fried beef with cold tequila is served here."},{"id":"marker18","name":"The Prime Inn","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious jugged rat tails with orange kumis is served here."},{"id":"marker19","name":"Sor'th'lush Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker20","name":"Macheaplean Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker21","name":"Diragzdus Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker22","name":"Tlaugheimyd Waterfall","legend":"The rapids of an exceptionally beautiful waterfall."},{"id":"marker23","name":"Solzan Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Sranar War. \r\nDate: March 26, 238 Leighton Era."},{"id":"marker24","name":"Broghird Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Phax War. \r\nDate: December 11, 1908 Leighton Era."},{"id":"marker25","name":"Dumun Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Tultochan Conflict. \r\nDate: December 12, 189 Leighton Era."},{"id":"marker26","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=9715467384627\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=9715467384627\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker27","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=9715467382273\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=9715467382273\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker28","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=9715467385797\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=9715467385797\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker29","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=9715467384016\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=9715467384016\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker30","name":"Dungeon","legend":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=9715467385520\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=9715467385520\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker31","name":"Srath Monster","legend":"Rumors say a relic monster of 7 m long inhabits Srath Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"id":"marker32","name":"Axbroke Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 19 m long."},{"id":"marker33","name":"Hathers Monster","legend":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 37 m long."},{"id":"marker34","name":"Shatrek Warg","legend":"Elders speak of a great Warg who inhabits Shatrek hills and doesn't mind human flesh."},{"id":"marker35","name":"Gerkradh Mountain","legend":"A sacred mountain of Qishikash Deities. Height: 3721m."},{"id":"marker36","name":"Oldshund Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Linzarism."},{"id":"marker37","name":"Chaghel Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Trow (Dark Elfish) Church."},{"id":"marker38","name":"Tuzandun Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Bearseguard Gods."},{"id":"marker39","name":"Klassik't Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Qishikash Deities."},{"id":"marker40","name":"Slalluph Bisons","legend":"A gang of mounted brigands."},{"id":"marker41","name":"Sonas Snakes","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker42","name":"Sazjuj'i Rats","legend":"A gang of mounted bandits."},{"id":"marker43","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker44","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker45","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker46","name":"Stios Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠰᡳᡡ᠑᠐ᠻᢛᠼᡔᡞᡏᠵᡍᡖ᠀ᠳᡑᡗᢡᠧᠮᠯᢟᢀᠵᠮᠵᢥᢤᠦᠽᢢᡰᠾᢂᡐᢟᡁᡁᠮᠨᠼᠮ᠐ᢒᢤᠿᠲᠳᡠᡑᡱᡑᡕᠻ᠐ᢛᡰᡝᢛᠲᡀᡍᢐᢛᡰ</div>"},{"id":"marker47","name":"Whitham Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ⳫⳂⳞ ⳀⳭⳈⲸ⳾ⲺⳂⳢⲾⳭⳁⲲ⳾ⳂⳞ⳩ⳫⳐⳈⳔⳒⳎ⳾ⳔⳀⳘⳭⳘⳎ ⳢⲾ⳹ ⳤⳎⳜ⳧ⳃⳃⳀ⳥ⳌⳚⲴⳆⲼ⳥ⳈⳬⳊⳄⳐ⳥ⳜⳫⳒⲺⳖⳚⳞ⳥⳪ⳎⳔⳚⳎⳚ ⳎⲺⳔⲴ⳩Ⲿ ⳢⳜⲾⳆⳜ⳹⳾ⲶⳀⳐ⳪ⳚⳒⳞⳐⲺⳈ </div>"},{"id":"marker48","name":"Ruined Outpost","legend":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker49","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker50","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker51","name":"Eryndhethagiad Library","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker52","name":"Travelling World-famous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this world-famous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker53","name":"Travelling Wondrous Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this wondrous circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker54","name":"Kilalar Tournament","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a tournament of acumen in Kilalar, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"id":"marker55","name":"Srataphju Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Srataphju, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker56","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Chartondon River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker57","name":"Leopards migration","legend":"A huge group of leopards are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker58","name":"Peculiar mirage","legend":"This peculiar mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker59","name":"Sralas Ravine","legend":"The Sralas Ravine. Locals claim that it is the home of strange monsters."},{"id":"marker60","name":"Apjezrash Portal","legend":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major city. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"id":"marker61","name":"Chix Portal","legend":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major city. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"id":"marker62","name":"Tulaburaz Portal","legend":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major city. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"id":"marker63","name":"Nalas Portal","legend":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major city. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"id":"marker64","name":"Lothiylnar Portal","legend":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major city. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"id":"marker65","name":"Batirara Portal","legend":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major city. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"id":"marker66","name":"Izachish Portal","legend":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major city. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"id":"marker67","name":"Stones Portal","legend":"An element of the magic portal system connecting major city. The portals were installed centuries ago, but still work fine."},{"id":"marker68","name":"Demonic Rift","legend":"A rumoured demonic rift in this area is causing an emmissary to step through with an all-powerful relic."},{"id":"marker69","name":"Disturbed Burial","legend":"A burial site has been disturbed in this area, causing the dead to rise and attack the living."},{"id":"marker70","name":"Givziedak Necropolis","legend":"Rising from the desolate landscape, this sinister necropolis is a testament to necromantic power. Its skeletal spires cast ominous shadows, concealing forbidden knowledge and arcane secrets."},{"id":"marker71","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4639\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker72","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/3351\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker73","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1198\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker74","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/5325\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker75","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1999\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker76","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4786\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker77","name":"The Party","legend":"Current location of the adventuring party."}]
